<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Ibritotee</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibritotee Borreesendeexxa Erga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibritotee</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibr.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Erga Ibritotee</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Tinni erga borreessendeek jabaxxi xaa'nensha insa'ne'n gelteemmaxxee ifixxa amana waalatee shiqqeemmaxxe amaagne'aatemman; kunni borreesanji Ibiritotixxe amaagnye'a kokeessa'neexxi Yessuusi Kiristoosi dhugaatixxenna muuxamiinxe Mageniinxe leella kadeexxa leellishateeten. Tinni amaagne amana ifixxe'ni jabataashsha jajjabeesaan; isinna tennee assaa wodda sase dhugaatixxa yaane farri asseexxi leellishatiten.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Adhdheexxi rakko darree'ni Aabi'a dhugaatike ajajemmallo kadeek Yessuusii duuchchii woddike Mageniink Belton; isi Mageniinke Belto kadatinna edixxe kakoxxe wabeekonaa'n, Muusenaa'ninna iimixxe ergannanaa'ni hara lumooshsha caaleeken.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Yessuusi edixxe kakoxxe qeesenaa'ni hara caaleeke duuchchii woddike umo qeesichcho kadeexxa Mageni ifike uminni haaso'edheen.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Yessuusi darree'ni amaagnichchi cubbotenaa'ni, soda'atenaa'ninna reyotena'ni anjiremaan; Yessuusi umo qeesichcho kadeemmashshanni Ibiritotixxe amanaxxe aaduwwa'ninna horiinxi tolchema'n gaaddidotishsha uundendaammaxxa anjirensha dhugaatixxe kaddaashsha asse'een.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafik borreessanji Isira'eelixxe jirte'ni gurra fule'eemmake mannixxa amana fakkeeniinsha la'oofatati (hafu. 11) tennee erga haassessaakiir ifixxe amana'ni jabaataashsha kulaan; iittanni (hafu. 12) tenne erga haassesaakiir ille ifixxa Yessuusi'ni uggudhati ifixxe amana'ni ti'n hiyye hedhaashshanna heene bifaxxi rakkonna abari insa'ne'ni geyoole ossinaashsha gorsaan; iittanni muuxamake'ni gorsa uwwatikanna xexxe'achchotika hiyyichcho uwwati qunqumaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichchoo: Mageni Kiristoosinni leelleexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosi erganna caalaake kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosi Muuseenna Iyyasuu'u caalaake kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosixxe qeesummaxxa caala <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosixxe kako aaggoxxa caala <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:11-9:22">8:11—9:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosixxe tolcheemmaxxa caala kada <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Amanatika lumminne <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageno gammachchiisaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxaamiinxa soodachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ququmaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniink Belti Ergannatenaa'n Caalaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Mageni olminaa'n safeexxi gargar hexxeexxe yannuwa'ninna gargar hedheeke oruwwinni wabeekoti darree'n annuwwa no'oke'n haaso'eexxi, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ta'a konne udumike baro'n kinni duuchchiinxa yaane dhaalaashsha asseekenna isi darree'n duuchchiinxa yaane dade'eeke ifike beltonni no'o'n haaso'e. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Isi Magniinke ulfinna ifisaakenna isike adabixxe kuta kadeexxi, ifike lumoke hiyyichchinni duuchchiinxa yaane kiphe abide'een. Manjiinxa cubbo luqqi asseechchi uduma iimate'n Lumoke Magnike midda'n offo'le.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Tennexxee isi dhaaleek summi ergannatike summanaa'ni caalaamma qicishshanni isi ergannatenaa'ni hara lumooshsha caalaaken.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Magen ergannati giddii'n mittetanna midde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Ati anke belto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ani techcho atee i'leennen» iittanni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Ani, Anna isike kadannon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">isinna anke Belto kadaan» hiyyeexxi hexxeba'a.<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Iittanni Mageni ifika angafa belto kaba butti'aa ergee wodda, «Iimatixxi erganna duuchcha isi'a sagaddaan» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ergannatixxeenna haaso'aa wodda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Erganna ifixxa diidalluwwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diidalluwwa yookaan hafuuruwwa kada dande'a</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">ifixxa ergannanna giiratike bubenjo assaan» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ifike Beltixxee kinni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Ee, Magenoo! Mootte atixxi duuchchi woddinaa'n duuchchii woddi'a hexxaaxxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">qullummatinna atixxe moottummaxxe bokko kaddaan.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Qullumma eettete; fuggaalessumma jibbittete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Tennexxee Mageni Gootti atike jaaluwwi iimi darre atee ofo'lishe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">gammashshotixxa zayitenna ate'n hariire.»<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Iittanni higgeenna «Ee, Goottaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Ati Sirende'ni buttixxa booso ofo'lishshette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">iimuwwatinna atixxe angaxxe hujuwwan.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Iimatinna butta baxxaan, ati kinni hexxato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">kunnichchi duuchchi seemmuffa mudaan.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Atinna konnechuwwa ejjiinsha mirqitatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">seemmatishshanna kunnichchuwwi jijjiiremmaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ati kinni duuchchii wodda atende;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">atik barinna muuxama afeba'a.»<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Mageni ifixxe erganna giddii'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Atika naapha atixxe lekkake uggudhisanjo assanno qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">anke midda'ni ofo'li!» hiyyeemmaxxi heenetemma'a?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Erganna duuchcha anjirema dhaalaake manna ergatendo'a ergendaaxxe erganjuwwa hufuuruwwabaata?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lumoxxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Tennexxee lanqenexxe yaanenaa'ni deenennexxi inbabe'noshsha eettenne lanqennexxe yaanexxee caala xexxe'ata no'oo hassissaan. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Tinninna kaddaachchi iimike erganji darree'n haaso'eemeek hiyyichchi dhugaatike kadeexxenninna konne hiyyichcho qaxxaamuranna konne hiyyichcho ajajema gopha hassissaaxxe mura woxxiseexxenni, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />no'ota iitta hexxeexxa lumoxxa anjirensha gagga'mi hinoonnole hittata baanje fula dandeennannota? Tennee anjirensha sirete'n ifike uminni Gootti lallabe; isonaa'ni laqeek manninna tenneenni no'aa kokeesse. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Magenikinna beesisuwwik masotinna gargar gargar hedheeke mambe'uwwinni iittanni ifixxe fedhiinni uwweendeexxe Woyyichchi Hafuurixxe uwwaarinni tennee yaanuwwaniinxee dhugaa kule'een.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Dayyuwwa Ifika Fakkaate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Tennee isexxee haasonna'ennexxa, daggaaxxa butta duuchcha Mageni erganna galchitaashsha assebaan. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Yaane kinni mitti wele bakka'n Woyyichchi maxaafi giddo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Ati isoo heddotaa manji maachcho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">isi'a xexxe'attota'a manjiink belti maachcho?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ergannatenaa'n isoo heeno qico<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookaan heenoxxe yanna'a hiyya dandeessissaan.</char></note> shiixishshetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">ulfinniinkanna galatiinka kallachcha iso'n uggitetten.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Duuchchiinxa yaane lekka isixxi hunda isi'a hirendaashsha assitette.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Mageni duuchchiinxa yaane isi hunda hirendashsha assaa wodda, isi'a hirendaashsha assebaak gatteexxi yaane mittechchinna hedhebaan; kaddo malee ta'a duuchchiingechchi isi'a hiremee'naa uundabe'no. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Yaane kinni Mageniinke badhaadhinni manji duuchchixxee reyo maqo'a ergannatenaa'n heeno qico heeno'maashsha assemeemmak Yessuusi, reyotixxa rakko adhdheemmaxxee ta'a ulfinniinkinna galatiink kallachchi iso'n uggeme'naa uundaannon.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Duuchchiinxi yaane isinninna isi'a dadendeek Mageni, heddo oose ulfinniinbaa iyyedago'a insa'nexxe anjirenshake ke'insanjo Kiristoosii'i rakkoti geyeeke kadaashsha issoo assa hassisseemman. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Manjo woyyonsaakinna iikki woyyoomaammaki manni duuchchiing mitte annixxe oosen; tennexxee Yessuusi insa'nee «Dayyuwwaa» hiyyeexxi ye'atee shookabaan. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Tennexxee woyyichchi maxaafi giddo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«Summa atika anke dayyuwwa'n kulannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Mageniinxe tuuta giddonna atika galata faaroti faarsannon» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Iittanni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Ani adde anxa iso'ni uggudhannon.»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:13">higgeenni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Kunse, aninna Mageni ani'a uwweexxi oose!» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Tennexxee tinni oose maalakanna munde afe'eeke manna kandeemmashshanni Yessuusinna insa'neshshanni manjok kade; tenneenna asseechchi ifixxe reyonni ookkonee reyoti hana baallooma afe'eeka dabiloosii'i balleeso'aten. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Iittanni insa'neke hedhoti baro duuchcha'n reyotixxe soda'axxe garbuma'ni usuremeemmakaara leexa fulcho'aten. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Isi dageechchi erganna qarqaro'aate kaddebaak Abirihaamixxa horte qarqaaro'aate kaddeexxa ege'nendeexxen. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Tennexxee duuchchiinxe yaanenni dayyuwwa ifika faakaata isi'a hassissaxxe kadde; tenneenna asseechchi mararaakenna xuurameessa umo qeesichcho kadeexxi Magenokee ergatemo'aanna ardiinxa cubbo biro'aatemman. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Isi ifinge uminninni hega uudemeemmaxxa yanna rakko adhdheemmaxxee hega uudemaaka duuchcha gargaara dande'aan.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Muusenaa'n Sa'aake Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Yoona hano iimika ye'injo qoodendineek woyyoole dayyuwwaa, no'oxxe amanake ergamallonna umo qeesichcho kadeeka Yessuusii'i hedde. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Muuse Mageniinke mine duuchcha'ni xuurameesake kadeemmashshanni Yessusinna isoo baallonseeke Mageni'a xuurameesakemman. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Mine ijaadhak ookkone mine caalaaka ulfinna afe'eemmashshanni Yessuusinna Muusenaa'n caalaaka ulfinna afa hassissaake kade'een. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Mitti mittingi mini ifi ifike ijaarallo afe'en; yaane kinni duuchchiinxa yaane ijaareek Magenoken. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Muuse edi'a haaso'endaaxxe yaanexxee dhugaa kula'n Mageniinke mine duuchcha'ni mitte erganjishsha xuurameessakemman. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Kiristoosi kinni Mageniinke mine'n xuurameessa beltishshaten; no'onna addantannoxxa yaanenna ifi saandannoxxa adde jabaante abixinonnole isike minen.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amana Gophatixxee Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Tennexxee Woyyichchi Hafuuri hiyya'nee qici</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Techcho haaso'a isika laqqinoole<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />Qiilla gammoojje'n hega anee uudinemmaxxa barra</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">Xaqarot assitinemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">qalbe ha'nooxxa jabeesexxinoqqe'e.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Annuwwi ha'nook anee ookko hega undeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">anee qore qo'niseen; assennexxa duuchchanna shoole tomme wogga'a uunde.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Tennexxe eettene ila'ninna mufatennexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‹Qalbe insa'neexxi duuchchi wodda dedhake'n ibbaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">anka oranna egennebaan› hiyyenne.<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Tennexxee mufatennexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‹Anxe hafuura addhdhabaa haranga e'yinabaan› hiyye kakateenne.»<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Anke dayyuwwa ha'nonaa'ni ayyinna hedhaake Mageninaa'ni uduma hissitaaxxi cubbitenna amandabaaxxi qalbe hexxabaasha xexxe'ate. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Yaane kinni ha'nonaa'ni ayyinna cubbotte'ni sobeme'naa qalbe isixxi dillotabaashsha «Techcho» hiyyendaaxxi barra hexxe'naanni barra barra'n weli weli gorse. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Sirete'n anfeennaxxa amana muuxamii qico'ni jabeessine abixxinonnole Kiristoosinni welti qoodeemmannoke kandannon. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Tinninna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Techcho haaso'a isika laqqinaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">xaqaroti assinemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ta'anna qalbe ha'nooxanna jabeessexxinoqqe'e» hiyyende haaso'endemmashshaten.<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Haaso'a isika laqeexxi xaqartichchake kade'eemmakiir ayyeerama? Ookkone Muuse akeeka'ni Gibtsee'n fulchemmake mannammabaata? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Shoole tomme wogga Mageni itti mufateemmaki ayyeera'nitemma? Cubbo hujee'naa renshi insa'neek qiilla gamoojje giddo ibee gateemmake ookkone mannammabaata? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Iittanni ookkone ajajema gibeemmake manna kadoole malee, «Anxe hafuura adhdhabaa ee'yitinaba'a» hiyyeexxi insa'neexxee kakateemmak ayyeeramma'a? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Yoona insa'ne e'ya dande'a gonpheemmaxxi buuto amana gopha insa'nexxe kaddeexxa uundeennen.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Edike Sanbatixxi Hafuura Adhdhaa Mageniinke Ardi'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Yoona Mageniinxe hafuura adhdhaba e'yatee uwwendeemmaxxi iitti addachchiisa ta'anna hexxeemmashshanni hexxeemmaxxee ha'nonaa'ni ayyinna eettene'a geyebaak gatabaashsha xexxe'anto. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ookkone manni'a wengeele lallabendeemmahshanni no'aanna lallabende'een; yaane kinni insa'ne lanqeeka ookkonee hiyyichcho amanati adhdha gonpheemmaxxee insa'ne'a la'o uwweba'a.<verse eid="HEB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />No'o amannennek kinni eettene Mageniinxe hafuura adhdhabaa e'yinannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">Magenikinna «Tennexxee mufatennexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‹Anxe hafuura adhdhabaa e'yinaba'a› » hiyye'een.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">Kaddo malee'e butta duuchcha dadendeexxe yannanaa'n huje isixxi muuxendeexxen.<verse eid="HEB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Eettene torbaxxe barraxxee mitte booncho'n, «Eettenee torbaxxa barra Mageni huje ifixxe duuchchinaa'n hafuura adhdheen» hiyyedheen. <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Iittanni tennee bakka'ninni higgeenni «Anxe hafuura adhdhabaa haranga e'yinaba'a» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Eettene hafuura adhdhabaa ta'anna e'yaakiir mitti mitti hedheen; ediseexxi eettenee eloxxa odo laqemak manni ajajema gophatenaa'n kexxeexxa hafuura adhdhabaa e'yineba'a. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Tennexxee Mageni, «Techcho» hiyyeexxi higgeen mitte barra mure; tinninna heddo bari uduma Daawwiti darree'ni «Techcho hafuura isika laqqinoole qalbe ha'nooxxa jabeessexxinoqqe'e» hiyyende konnechchi edo kulendeemmashshaten.<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Iyyaasu hafuura adhdha insa'ne'a uwwe'echcho kadde'eele ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni haaroba «Techcho» hiyya'n wele barraxxee silaat haaso'ammabaan. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Tennexxee Mageniinke ardi'a Edike Sanbatixxi hafuura adhdha ta'anna edi'a hexxeen. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Tinninna kaddeechchi Mageniinxe hafuura adhdhabaa e'yaak duuchchi, Mageni ifixxe hujenaa'n hafuura adhdheemmashsha isinna iittanni ifixxe hujenaa'n hafuura adhdhaan. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Yoona ayyinna ookkone mannixxa ajajensha gophaka fakkeenna hordofeexxi ibabaashsha, eettene Mageniinxe hafuura adhdhabaa e'yatee jabaanto!<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Mageniink hiyyichchi hedhaakenna hujaaken; lame qarke wolaantichchi caala qara afe'eeken; lubbotanna irra, mikitakanna dhuka gargarti hiissaa qici'a lullugee e'yaan; qalbetika yaadanna yaada qo'nisee afaan. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Mageniinxe ille edo sho'ondaaxxi mitte dadanna hexxeba'a; no'o ifixxee hiissichcho uwwa hassissaake isi edo duuchchiinxi yaane ce'e hiteexxenna xuddi hiteexxen.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesoletika Umo Qeesichcho Yessuusi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Yoona iimuwwatibaa me'eeka Lumoka umo qeesichcho Mageniinka Belto Yessuusii'i anfeennaxxee amana no'oxxa jaabeessine abixxino. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />No'o anfeennek umi qeesichchi ifigopha no'oxxe'ni no'aa mararaaken; isi mitte cubbonna hujeba malee'e duuchchiinxe yaanenni no'oshshanni hega uudeme'eeken.<verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Yoona mararte alfinnonna'aanna hassissaaxxe yaane'n no'oo gargaraaka badhaadha alfinnannoshsha eettene badhaadhiinxe mootebaa amanati shinqo.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Mitti mittiniing umi qeesichchi manni giddii'ni filemaan; Mageniinxe kaddeexxe yaane'ni manniinxe tukke kadeexxi cubbottee kaddaaxxa eettenee uwwanna tolcha shiqishatee baalloonsemaan. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Isi ifingee uminni ifixxa ifi gonphe afeeke kadeemmaxxee qalbeefachcho afebaakeeri'aanna deedhake'n ibaakeeri'a marara dande'aan. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Isi ifike umixxe cubbo'aanna wele mannixxe cubbo'a tolcha shiqisa hasiseechchi tennexxeeten. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Aarooni ye'emeemmashshanni Mageni ye'eeke umo qeeseichcho kadoole malee'e konnee ulfinna ifi'a adhdha dande'aak ayyinna hedheba'a. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Iittanni Kiristoosi umo qeesichcho kadatika ulfinna isi ifixxe fedhiinni adhdhebaan; yaane kinni Mageni isoo, «Ati anke Belton, Ani techcho atike Anna kadeennen» hiyye. <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Iittanni wele bakka'ni «Melketsedeqike baalloomishsha ati duuchchii woddi'a qeesichchoken» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yessuusi tennee butta'ni hedhemma wodda reyotenaa'ni isoo anjira dande'aake Magenibaa soodachchonna kadha lumoxxe raarenninna indiddonni welti shiqise; hara ba'lake kadati ajajemeeemmaxxeenna soodachcho isixxa Mageni laqe. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Mageniinke Belto kadeexxe kaddolenna midde adhdheexxe rakkonaa'n ajajensha barate. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Konne qicinn wo'make kadeexxi afemeechchi uduma isi'a ajajemaake duuchchi'a duuchchi woddixxe anjirensha'a buutote kade. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Melketsedeqike baalloomishsha umo qeesichcho asseexxi Mageni isoo baalloonse.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanate'n Jabaatagophatixxee Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tenne yaannexxee haasonnannoxxa heddo yaane anfe'eennen; yaane kinni ha'noxxi qalbeeffachchotixxi dande'a heenoxxe kaddeemmaxxe ha'no'n barrisa ha'urtaan. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Tenne yanna ha'no barachchiisaluwwake sila kada hassissaa wodda, reefi Magniinke hiyyichchixxa siretixxa barachcho ha'noo barachchiisak manji ha'no'aa hasisaan; ha'no'aa hasisaachchinna jabaxxe ita kaddebaak adoten. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ado hasisaak duuchchi annote kademmaxxee qullumatixxa barachcho isi ege'nebaan. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Jabaxxi ita kinni eloxxa fuggoxxenaa'n gargar hiissatee ifi leenjiseeke lummollamma manni'aaten.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Yoona Kiristoosixxee uwwendeemmaxxe eettene siretixxe barachcho waalennexxi wo'mate kaddeexxe barachchobaa sa'no! Rerteexxe hujenaa'n aadde aagatinna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">woyi fuldabaaxxe aadanaa'n</char></note> Magenoke'ni amanatixxee wirri assine barachchiisonnoqqe'e. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Iittanni xammaqatixxa anga hana uggatixxa reyotenaa'ni ke'atixxanna duuchchi woddixxe murtexxa barachcho wirri assine barachchiisonnoqqe'e. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Mageni eetii no'aa uwwoole tennee assinannon.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Mittele ifi insa'ne'a ifeekaara, iimixxa uwwa maqeekaara, Woyyichchi Hafuurnaa'ni qoodemeekaara, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />eloka ookkonee Mageniinka hiyyichchonna daggaaxxe butta duuchchixxa hunna maqeekaara <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />uduma kinni waakateekaara haaroba aadde aagatibaa insa'nee hiissa dandeessisabaan. Yaane kinni insa'enni ifike umixxe balleessanni Mageniinka Belto haaroba fanninsaan, isonna salphinsaan.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Duuchchi wodda ise hana ganaaka xeena ha'wa'ni iso'n wiilsaake manji'anna la'o uuwwaaki bogi eebba Magenokenaa'n adhdhaan. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Yaane kinni utetanna hagala fulchaak bogi la'o afebaake kadaan; isixxi badinemanna shiqe'een; isiki muuxaminna giirate'n gubataten.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Anke jaaluwwaa! Fedhee qiconna iitta haasonnonnolenna midde ha'noxxe anjireshanni welti abidendeexxa lumoxxa yaane afine'eexxa konkeennen. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ha'no woyyoole gargaartineemmaxxee ta'i qico'ninna insa'nee gargaartinaammaxxee hujjineexxa huje isike summi'aanna leellishshineexxa jaalala dedhatee Mageni xaqartichchakebaan. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Ha'no duuchchiing addatineexxi heqqixxina'neexxa yaane alfitinaa qico'n iitta hedheeka ha'noka si'a muuxamii qico'n leellishshinaashsha halchinaannen. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Amanatinna oossati ookkonee addachchiisatika hiyyichcho dhaalaaka manna fakkaatinaashshate malee booso'uwwak kaddino'a hansaabe'no.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniinxe Addachchiisaxxa Dhugaaleessumma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Mageni Abirihaami'a addachchiisa uwwee wodda itti kakataak ifinaa'n sa'aak wele hedha gopheemmaxxee ifi'ni kakateexxi <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />«Dhugaandinni atee eebbisannon; horte atixxanna bira sa'isannon» hiyye. <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abirihaaminna osse heqedhati eettenee uwwendeexxa addachchiisa alfe. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Manni ifinaa'n sa'aake summinni kakataan; iitti kakonna hiyyendeexxe yaanexxa dhugaaleessumma kokeesitammaxxee oddo insa'nexxe'n kexxeemmaxxi moronsha duuchcha fuggussendaan. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Konne qicinni Mageni jijjirendabaaxxa fedhii ifixxa ookkone addachchiisatika hiyyichcho dhaalaakeeri'a kokeessa haseemmaxxee eettene addachchiisa kakot kokeesse. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Mageni haranga dhara haaso'a dande'aba'a; isi lame jijjirendabaaxxe yaanuwwanni no'oo edo hexxeexxa eettenee adde abixxatee no'o isibaa baanjennek jabaxxa dayyeefachcho alfinnannoshsha asse'een. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tinni adde hedho no'oxxee ookkone lele'mammabaakenna addatemeeke mehaalqi hiyyemeeke sibljishaten; tinni Yessuusi'n anfe'eennexxi addee ookkonee seemmati golo saxxeexxi giddike galmi giddi'a e'yitaan. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Iitti bakkanna no'oxxee Yessuusi ediseexxi e'yemmaxxen; isinna Melketsedeqike baalloomishsha duuchchi woddi'a umo qeesichcho kade'een.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniika Qeesichcho Melketsedeqii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melketsedeqii kunni Saalemike moyanjonna Lumoke Magenike qeesichchomman; isinna Abirihaami moyanjuwwa injifate higaa'naa afemeexxi isoo eebbise. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Abirihaaminna duuchchiinxe yaanenaa'n tommitte aadheexxi iso'n uwwe; isike summixxi taakkaxxi tika «Qullummatike moyanjo» langaxxi «Saalemike moyanjo» hiyyaten; Saalemike moyanjo hiyya nage'iinke moyanjo hiyyaten <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Melketsedeqi kunni anna ama yookaan ilatika daalo afebaan; baro isikee ke'it, isixxe hedho'aanna muuxami hedheba'a; yaane kinni isi Mageniinke Beltike fakkeenna kadeexxi duuchchi woddi'a qeesichcho kadee hedhaan.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Kunni manji isi hittee qico lumoke kadeexxa hedde! Ayihudiinxe gosake hundaayyeti anna kadeek Abirihaami midde booji'oti eettene alfeexxe yaanenaa'n tommitte fulcheexxi iso'n uwween. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Iitti qeesummi insa'ne'a uwwemeemmaxxi Leewwixxi oose fedhee qiconna midde insa'nek dayyuwwi Abirihaamixxe horte kadoolenna, ardakenaa'ni kunninna ifike dayyuwwanaa'n tommitte aa'naashsha seeri insa'ne ajajaan. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melketsedeqii kunni, kinni isixxe ilenshak daali Leewwixxe gosanaa'nitebaan; kaddo maalee isi Abirihaaminaa'n tommitte aadhe; ookkonee addachchiisatik hiyyichchi isi'a uwweme'eemmaka Abirhaamiinna eebbise. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Maa'nii angafakenaa'n eebba adhdhaaxxa mama affeexxe yaaneba'a. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Mitte orinni tommitte aaxxaaxxi Leewwixxi oose wele manjishshanni rertaaxxen; weli orinni kinni tommitte aadhaak hedhoke kadeexxi hedhaaxxa isixxee dhugaa kulendeeke Melketsedeqiten. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Wele waalin iikki tommitte aadhaammak Leewwi, ifinge uminninni Abirihaami darree'n tommitte uwwe'een hiyya dandeessissaan. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Tinninna kaddaachchi Melketsedeqi Abirihaaminni afemeemmaxxa yanna, Leewwi ookkone wodda, hundaayyetika ifika anna Abirihaamike gudeedi giddo hedheemman hiyyaten.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Melketsedeqishsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Iikki seeri ardakee uwwemeemmak Leewwixxe qeesummaxxe hundaayyeshshatemman; yoona Leewwixxe qeessuma'ni silaan wo'munte afende'eechcho kaddeele Aaroonikishshate kaddebaak Melketsedeqixxe qeesumake baalloomishsha hedheek weli qeesichchi daga mayee hassissamma'a? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Qeesumatixxi jijjiirensha hexxaa wodda seerikinna jijjiirema hassissaaxxen. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Tinni yaane duuchchi isixxee haaso'endeek qeessichchi isi wele gosati minena'niten; ookkone gosati mininaa'n ookkone tolchimalchibaa shiqeexxi ergatemeek ayyinna hedhebaan. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Tinninna Gootti no'ok Yessuusii Yihudake gosati mininaa'n dageexxa ege'nedeexxen; Muuse qeese uuddaaxxenni haaso'ee wodda Yihudaka gosati mine uuddaaxxenni haaso'eexxi mitte yaannenna hexxebaan.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Tinni yaane hara ifake kaddeexxi leellitaak Melketsedeqishsha hedheeki weli qeesichchi dagaaxxe yannan. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Isi qeesichchoke kadeek baxxabaaxxe hedhoxxe hunna qicishshate malee'e isi ilenshati dageexxe sannek seerishshanna aadashshatebaan. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />«Melketsedeqike qeesomike baalloomishsha ati duuchchi woddi'a qeesichchoken» hiyyendee borreessende'een. <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Iikki ediki ajaji goofakenna woyi fulabaake kadeemmaxxee gate'een. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Kunni Muusek seeri ayyeenna wo'make assa dande'a gophaammaxxee Magniinbaa shinqannoxxi wele eldaaxxi adde dagge'een.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Tenne'ninni hana tinni qeesumma Mageniinxe kako belo kaddeexxebaan; weli konne edi darre qeesete kadeemmaakiir kako beltemman. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Yessuusi kinni qeesichcho kadeek Mageniinxe kakoniten; tinninna kaddeechchi Mageni isixxee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Mageni ‹Ati duuchchi woddi'a qeesichchoken› hiyyee kakate'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">ifika yaadanna jijjiirabaan» hiyyendeexxi isixxe kulendeemma qicishshaten.<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Tennee kakonaa'n kexxeexxinni Yessuusi eettene woyya hiyyendaaxxe kako aaggo'a waasete kade'een. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ifixxe ergatenshanni me'inabaashsha reyo insa'nee hoyyiteemmaxxee eettene edixxe qeesek laakkossi heddokemman. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Yessuusi kinni duuchchii woddi'a hedhaake kadeemmaxxe qeesumma isixxi jijjiirendabaaxxen. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Tennexxee insa'nexxee soodata'ni duuchchi wodda hedhoti hedhaammaxxee isi darree'ni Magniinbaa dagaakaara woma qicinni anjira dande'aan.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Yoona no'aa hasisaak, woyyichchi ci'memabaak, luqqichchi cubbaleeyyetenaa'n gargar higeekenna iimuwwati iimi darree xalli hiyye ulfaateeke iitta hedheek umo qeesichchoni. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Isinna wele umo qeesehsha ediseexxi ifixxe cubboxxee ookkoneechchi uduma ardiinxe cubboxxee barra barra'ni tolcha shiqishsha isoo hassissaba'a; yaane kinn ifi tolchake asseexxi shiqisheexxa yanna, tennee yaane lebabaa qicinni muuxedheen. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Iikki Muusek seeri ifi gopheeka manna umo qeese asseexxi baallonsedheen; seeri uduma daggeexxi kako aaga kinni duuchchii woddi'a wo'make kadeeka Belto baalloonse'een.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Haaroxxe Kako Aagaka Umo Qeesole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Yoona haasonaannexxe yaanuwwanaa'ni umo yaane tinni: iimuwwate'ni ookkone lumoke Mageniinxe mooteke midda'ni ofo'leeka iitta hedheeka umo qeesichcho anfe'eennen. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Isinna manjoke kadebaak ookkone Gootti kaaseeke dhugaatike duunkaana kade'eeke Galmike erganjon. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Mitti mittiingi umi qeesichchi baalloomaachchi uwwattanna tolcha shiqisho'aaten. Tennexxee kunni umi qeesichchinna shiqishaaxxi mitte yaane isi'a hedha hassissaan. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Isi buttate'n hedheechcho kadeele umo qeesichcho kadammabaan; tinninna kaddaachchi Muuseke seerike ajajishsha uwwa shiqishaak manni hedhemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Insa'ne ergattemeek duunkaani iima hedheeke Galmike fakkeennanna gaaddisa kadeek giddon. Muuse ookkonee duunkaana giissatee ke'ee wodda, «Eettene kooba hana ate'n ifisemeek fakkeennishsha duuchchiinxa yaane assitattoshsha xexxe'at» hiyyaak ajaji uwwemeemmachchi tennexxeetemman.<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Yaane kinni Yessuusi oddichchake kade'eemmaxxi kako aaggo eettene edixxenaa'n caaldaammashshanni isi adhdheexxi iitti ergatensha insa'nexxenaa'n caaldaan; tinni kakonna kaasende'eek woyya afeexxe addachchiisatike hiyyichcho'niten. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Sirettixxi kako aaggo mitte xe'ya afa gophpheele langaxxee silaati boonchi hedhammabaan. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Yaane kinni Mageni aradake'n xe'ya afe'eemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Isira'eelike ardi'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Yihudake ardi'aanna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Haaroxxa kako aagannoxxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">barra daggaan hiyya'neen Gootti.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Tinninna Gibtseeke boganaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">insa'nee fulchonnaa anga insa'neexxa abidennexxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Edike insa'neke annuwwi'a aagennaxxe kakoshshatebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">tinninna kaddeechchi insa'ne anxe kako'n ti'ni hineba'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Aninna insa'ne'n gagga'm hiyyenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">hiyya'neen Gootti.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Eettene yanna uduma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Isira'eelike ardi'a aagaannoxxi kako konneechchi butta hexxeexxen hiyya'neen Gootti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Anka seera sammo insa'nexxi giddo uggannon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">insa'nexxe qalbe'ninna borreessannon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ani insa'neeke Mageno kadannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">insa'nenna anke arda kandaan.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Ta'anni edi'a ayyinna ollalcho ifika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">yookaan dayyo ifika, ‹Mageno ege'ni!› hiyya'n barachchiisabaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Tinni kaddaachchinna shiixxokenaa'n lumoki qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">insa'ne duuchchiing anee egennammaxxeeten.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Balleessa insa'neexxa gattoowwaali hiyyannon; insa'nexxa cubbonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">ta'anni edi'a qalli hiyyabe'non.»<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Tennee kako aaggo «Haaroxxe» hiyyeexxi eettene edixxa kako dullattete asse'een; tennexxee dullattete kaddeexxinna woyi fuldabaaxxi yaane baxxaaxxi yanna shiqqe'een.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Buttatike Duunkaan Giddo Assendaaxxa Magenooffachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Iitti siretixxi kako magenooffachchotixxa aadanna buttatike Galma affe'eemman. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Lame kuta afe'eemmak duunkaani qixxeesemeemman; taakkaxxe kuta'n xassiink uggemalchi, beerikinna woyyitte kebbo hexxemman; kunni boonchinna «Woyyitte» hiyyemaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Ookkone langake seemmati goli udumi darre Woyyitte Woyyo hiyyendaaxxe kuta hexxemman. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Ookko giddo worqeti hixaank gubemalchinna, werqeti buqemeek kakotik taaboti hedhemman; kunni kakoti taaboti meenni ise giddo hedheexxi worqetixxi qore, kichcho fulchiteemmaxxi Aaroonixxi siqichchonna tommi ajajuwwi itti borreesemeemmak lami kinoti bidiruwwi giddo hedhemman. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Konne taaboti hana hedheeka cubbo biratika tuphanjo buqqaaxxi ulfinniinxi kirubeeluwwa hexxemman; yaane kinn ta'a tenne yaanuwwaxxe mitte mittende yaanexxee haaso'a dandeenabe'non.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Duuchchiinxi yaane konne qicinni qixxeessendeechchi uduma qeese ifixxa ergatensha muuxxo'a duuchchii wodda ookkone duunkaanixxe siretixxe kuta giddi'a e'yitaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Yaane kinni eettene giddixxe kutabaa e'yaak ookkone umo qeesichcho callammani; e'yaamakinna woggate'ni mittele calla kadaa wodda, ifike umixxe cubboxxeenna ardi dedhik hujeexxe cubboxxee shiqqaammaxxa munde abidebaak haranga e'yaammaba'a. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Iikki siretik duunkaani hedhee qico'n Woyyitte Woyyobaa iyyemaraak ori leellebaake kadeexxa Woyyichchi Hafuur leellishaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Tinninna ta'ake barri'a fakkeennake kadaa wodda ookko shiqqaammaxxi uwwaarinna tolchuwwi magenooffataamake ookkone mannixxa sammo haranga luqqi assa dande'eba'a. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Tinni yaannuwwa duuchchi iitti haaroxxi aada dagga qico'n assendaammaxxe itatixxenna ha'wiinxe, iittanni gargar gargar hedheek luqqi hiyyatixxe aaduwwa callamman.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosixxa Munde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Yaane kinni Kiristoosi ta'a hexxeexxe elolla yaannuwwa'a umo qeesichcho kadeexxi dagee wodda manjiinxi anga giisitebaake, ookkone tenne dadaake kadebaake duunkaani giddo e'ye. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />E'yeekinna re'etixxanna jibootatixxa munde abideetebaan; yaane kinni duuchchi woddixxa wodo iyyedago'a ifixxa munde abixxeexxi mittele muxxamii qico'ni eettene Woyyite woyyobaa duuchchii woddi'a e'ye. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Gadhi darrek insa'nek bisi luqqi hiyyo'a ookkone batto'eeke mannike biso'n fixendaammaxxi re'etixxinna jibbootatixxi munde, iittanni re'etixxinna tolchakee gubendaammaxxe raadak bululi insa'nee luqqi asseechchinni <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />duuchchi woddike Hafuur darree'n ifi ci'mema beloke tolcha asseexxi Magenokee shiqisheeke Kiristoosixxi mundee hedhaaka Mageno magenoofantannoshsha no'oxxa sammo reyotibaa iyyemartaaxxe hujeenaa'n hittata caala luqqi assituta!<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Tennexxee ye'emeemmaakiir ookkonee addachchiisa uwwendeemmaka duuchchi woddika qadaada adhdho'a Kiristoosi haaroxxe kakoke oddichchani; tinni kaddeechchi manni siretixxe kako hunda hedhemma wodda hujeemmaxxe cubbonaa'n leexxa fulo'a isi reyemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Karra dhaalchissaaxxi badino hexxoole, iikki badineemaki manjichchi reyeexxa kokeessa hassissaxxa ege'nedeexxen. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Tinni kaddaachchi badino abiddaak manjichchi reyoole callan; yaane kinni iikki badineek manjichchi lubboti hedhee qico'n iitti badino abiddaba'a. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Tennexxee siretixxi kako midde munde belo hujete'n hosseemmaxxebaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Muuse mitte mittenga seerinka ajaja arda duuchcha'n haaso'eechchi uduma jibootatiinxa munde woddi'ik, diimmoxxe gedhebiinxe ordaninna hissoophike shafinni welti aadheexxi ookkone seeriinke maxxafa'ninna ardake'n fifixxe. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Fifixxee qicinna, «Heqqexxino'a Mageni ha'noo ajajeexxi eettene kakoixxi munde tenneten» hiyyeeten. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Iittanni eettene duunkaane'ninna iseke magenonfachchotikenna ergatenshatike mi'uwwa duuchcha'n munde fifixe. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Dhugaaten, heenoxxe yaanne gadhi darre duuchchiinxi yaane mundeti luqqi hiyya hassissaaxxa Muusek seeri ajajaan; munde dunedebaaki cubbotixxi gattowwaali hexxebaan.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Yoona iimixxe yaannuwwake fakkeenna kadeemmachchiir duuchchi tenne aadanni luqqi hiyya hassisseexxen iimate'n hexxeexxi yaanuwwa kinni konnee caalaake tolchinni luqqi hitaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kiristoosi ookkone dhugaatike duunkaanike fakkeenna kadeemakenna manjiinxe anganni hujemeemmake galmibaa e'yebaan; yaane kinni ta'a no'oxxee Mageni edo leellatee iima hedheeke galmibaa e'ye. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ayidootiink umi qeesichchi ifixxe kaddebaaxxa munde abideexxi wogga wogga'ninni Woyyitte Woyyobaa e'yammashsha Kiristoosi heddole ifi tolcho'a iima e'yebaan. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Iittate kaddeele butta duuchcha dadendeexxe yannanaa'ni Kiristoos heddoe rakko adhdha hassissamman; ta'a kinni bariinke muuxama'n ifi tolchake asseexxi cubbo fuggusso'a mittele duuchchii woddi'a leelle'een. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Manji mittele reyo'a ookkoneechchi uduma murte adhdho'a murende'een. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Kiristoosi heddi mannixxa cubbo fuggusatee iittanni mittele tolchemeedheen; isinna langaxxa leellaanni; tinninna isoo heqedhaakeeri'a anjirensha iyyedagateete malee cubbo ba'edhateetebaan.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mittele Duuchchi Woddi'a Kiristoosixxa Tolchensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Muusek seeri, edi'a daggaaxxe elola yaanuwwake gaaddisa malee eettene yaanuwwake dhugaatike bisobaan. Tennexxee wogga woggande'n duuchchii wodda cita belo higge higgeenni shiqaammak iikki tolchuwwi ookkonee magenooffachchotee dagaamak manna wo'make assa haranga dande'ebaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Iikki seeri insa'nee silaan luqqi assa dandedheele tolcha shiqashsha waala gonphammata? Iittanni magenooffachchotee dagama manni mittele duuchchi wodi'a luqqi hinammaxxee sa'mo insa'nexxe'n cubbaaleessumma insa'ne'n silaat laqendammabaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Yaane kinni kunni tolchuwwi wogga wogga'ninni cubbo qalli assaamakeeran; <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Tinninna kaddeechchi jibootiinxinna re'etixxi munde cubbo fugussa dande'a gophphammaxxeeten.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Tennexxee Kiristoosi butta duuchibaa dagee wodda hiyyeemma qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«Tolchakanna uwwa ati hassebexxo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">manjunte kinni ani'a qixxeessiteete.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ciincatike tocha'ninna cubbotee shiqaake tolcha'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">gammaddebexxon.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Eettene yanna ‹Anxee mirqemalcho maxaafa'n borreessendemmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Ee, Mageno kunse fedhii atixxa assonnaa dageennen› hiyyenne.»<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Tinniiri assendaashsha seeri kunni ajajeexxe kaddoolenna isi kinni sirende'n «Tolchakanna uwwa, ciincatika tolchanna cubbotixxee shiqaaka tolcha hassabexxo, iso'ninna gammadebexxo» hiyyaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Lebeexxi, «Kunse ani fedhii atixxa assonnaa dageennen» hiyye; langaka tolcha ti'ni asso'a siretika tolcha hoyye. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Tenne fedhiinni Yessuusi Kiristoosike maal darree'n mittele duuchchii woddi'a ookkone shiqeeke tolchinni woyyoommeennen.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Mitti mittiniing qeesichchi barra barra'n uurreexxi ergatemaan; haranga cubbo fugussa dande'abaaka ookkonee tolchuwwa duuchchii wodda shiqishaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Kiristoosi kinni mitte tolcha duuchchii woddi'a shiqisheexxi Mageniinke midda'n offo'ledheen. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Eettene yannanaa'ni isik naaphiir isixxe lekkake hadhisanjo kadaa qico heqqaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Tinninna kaddeechchi ookkone mitte tolchinni ookkone woyyomaakaara duuchchii woddi'a insa'ne mitte ci'ma beloke manna asse'een.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Woyyichchi Hafuurinna tennee yaanexxee no'aa dhugaa kula'neen; sirete'n hiyya'nee qici,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'ne'a aagannoxxi kako konneechchi butta hexxeen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">hiyya'nee'n Gootti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Anka seera insa'neexxe qalbe uggannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">insa'nexxe sammo'ninna isoo borreessannon.»<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Higeenni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">«Cubbo insa'neexxanna xaqaro insa'neexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">langaxxa qalli hiyyabe'no» hiyyaan.<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kunniir gottowwaal hiyyemmeechchi uduma ta'anni edi'a cubbotee shiqaak tolche hedheba'a.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gorsakanna Xixichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Yoona anke dayyuwwa Yessuusixxe mundenni Woyyitte Woyyobaa e'yatee riffii'i anfebe'no. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Kunninna ookkonne golo darree'ni, kunninna maala isik darree'n no'aa banemmake haarokenna hedhaake orinniten. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Mageniinke mine'n baalloonsemeeka lumoka qeesichcho anfe'eennen. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Tennexxee fuggoxxe sammonaa'n luqqi hiyyatee no'oxxa qalbe fiffilxine'e, no'oka biso ca'ichcha wodi'inni anshe'ne'e, qajeelto qalbenninna dhugaatixxe amananni Mageniinbaa shinqo. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Ookkonee addachchiisatika hiyyichcho no'aa uwweek xuurameesake kademmaxxee eettenee amannennexxi haasonnaannexxa adde duune abixxino. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Jaalalateenna eloxxe huje'a damanqannoshsha weli weli uundo. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Duuchchiing welti afemma'n weli weli jajaabeesino malee'e mitti mitti manni assammashsha bukki hiyya no'oxxa waallonnoqqe'e; tenne mannii'n Goottiinke daggixxi barra shiqqa'n daggeexxa uuddina'n tennee caalla asse.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Dhugaatixxa ege'na alfinneennechchi uduma egenna'n cubbo hunjoonole ta'anni edi'a weli cubbotee kadaak tolchi hedhabaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Ta'a gataachchi kinni sodaachchissaaxxe murtenna Mageniinka naapha ittaaxxa sodachchisaaxxa giira heqedha callan. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Muuseka seera tuffateek huuni manjinna lami yookaan sasi manji iso'n dhugaa kuloole isi mararte belo shiyemaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Mageniinka Belto tuffateek, isenni woyyomeexxa eettene kakotixxa munde batte yaaneshsha laakko'eek, badhaadhiinka Hafuuranna yowweek hittata caala mura woxxa isi'a hassisaachcho ha'no'ni labba? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />«Halo fula anxen, ani bado hiissannon» hiyyeeka isoo egeneennen; iittanni «Gootti ifike arda'n muraan» hiyyaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Hedhaake Magenixxe anga'n iba hara sodaachchissaaxxen.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Ifi ha'no'a xabeechchi uduma rakko giddo jabaxxe cichchanni ti'ni hitine uurritinemmaka ookkonee edika baro qalli hiyye. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Mitte mitte yanna manjii edo yowwedine'een; shorendine'een; wele wodda kinni iitta hexxeexxi rakko insa'ne geltemmake manninni welti mitteba rakko adhdhitine'een. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Ha'nooke uminni ha'no caaldaaxxanna duuchchii woddi'a hexxaaxxa karra iimma affine'eeke kaddineexxe egedineemmaxxee usuremeekeeri'a marartine; ha'noxxi karranna saamendaa wodda gammashshot adhdhitine.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Tennexxee hira lumoka affe'eexxa ha'noxxa addata mee hunne. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mageniinxa fedhii assitineexxi isika ookkonee addachchiisatika hiyyichcho adhdhitino'a osssat heqedha hassissaan. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Tinninna kaddaachchi heenoxxe yanna uduma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">«Isi iikki dagaak dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">hekkinna hiyyabaan.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Qullichchi kinni amanati hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">udumaa shishiqqeexxe kaddoole</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">Ani iso'n gammadabeno.»<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />No'o kinni ookkone amaneexxi anjiremeeke mannike manna malee'e udumi'a shishiqqeexxi ba'eemmake mannike mannabaan.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Amanatika Lumollamma Fakkeenuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Amanate hiyya addantennexxi yaane muuxxendaaxxa konkannoxxe uundaabe'noxxi yaanenna dhugaate kaddeexxa egennannoxxen. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Edik manninna galateefatemeemmak tennennideemman.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Dada duuchchanna Mageniinke hiyyichchinni dadendeexxa amanat qalbeeffantannon; tennexxee leellitaaxxi yaane dadendeek leellitaaxxenaa'nite kaddebaaxxa egennanno.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Aabeeli Qayeelikenaa'n caalaaka tolcha Magenokee amanat shiqishe; Mageni isika tolcha uuddaaxxenni haaso'ee wodda, isi manat qullichcha kadeexxa isi'a dhugaa kulende; Abeeli reyeenni hedheexxi midde amana ifixxi darree'n ta'i qico'n haaso'ate'ni hedheen.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Henook iso'n reyo geltabaashsha tennee buttaanaa'n amanat adhdheme; Mageni isoo adhdheemmaxxee afemebaan; adhdhemebaa edi darre is Mageno gammachchiiseexxa isixxee dhugaa kulende'een. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Amanat belo Mageno gammachchiisa dandeessissaba'a; tinninna kaddaachchi Mageniinbaa shiqaak duuchchi Mageni hedheexxanna isoo qalbeti halsaakeeri'aanna hira uwwaaxxa amana hassissan.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nohi leellitebaaniinxe yaanexxee Mageni isoo xexxe'achchiisee wodda Mageno sodaateexxi ifika mini hado anjiratee markaba amanat giisse; Nohixxe amananni butta duuchcha cubbitete kadeexxa egenendeexxi murte ise'n murende; Nohinna amanat afendaaxxa qullumma dhaalaake kade.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Abirihaami uduma qadaadi ifike assedheexxi adhaalaaxxe eettene bakkabaa mea'aashsha ye'emee wodda amanat ajajeme; isi haba'aa me'aaxxa ege'na gopheexxe kaddoolenna ishshi hiyyeexxi me'e. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Annafee boga'n hedheeke keessuntichchishsha ookkone addachchiisat uwweemmemake boga'n amanat offo'le; ookkone addachchiisatika hiyyichcho isinni welti dhaalaake Yisaaqishshanna Ya'iqoobishsha duunkaan giddo ofo'le. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Tenneennna asseechchi ookkonee jabaxxe boosoka Mageni qixxeseekanna ijareeka qachcha heqedhaammaxxeeten. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Saaranna addachchiisa isi'a uwweek Mageni xuurameessake kadeexxa egendemmaxxee cimatenaa'n kexxeexxa ila dandeetabaaxxe kaddeenni hexxeexxi midde siila'watixxa hunna alfiteek amanatiten. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Tennexxee reyeeke manjishsha uudeema'neeke Abirhaamii konne mittenaa'n iimixxe urjeshsha bira saxeexxinna abbayyaatike maanchishsha laakkossakee dandeessissabaaxxi horte afende.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Kunni manni duuchchi insa'ne'a uuwwendeemmaxxa addachchiisa alfebaang amana ifixxa abixeeshshanni reye; kaddo malee addachchiisati eettenee uwwendeemmaxxa yaanuwwa bayii'ninni anfeexxi alfineeshsha assine gammashshoti adhdhine; insa'ne buttate'n keessummatenna ifike boginaa'n shoremeeke manna kandeexxanna egenne. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Iitta hiyyaak manni ifike kadeeka boga heqqedha'neexxa ege'nishaan. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ookkone waale fulleemmaka boga silaa hendeechcho kaddeele ookko'a ille iima higa dandeennamman. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ta'a kinni ookkone caalaaka iima hedheeka boga halchinaan; Mageni insa'ne'a qachcha giisseemmaxxee insa'neke Mageno hiyyeme ye'ema shookeba'a.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Abirihaami Mageni isoo hega uudee wodda Yisaaqii'i tolchake asseexxi amanat shiqishe; iikki addachchiisatika hiyyichcho adhdheemmak Abirhaami ifika mitte belto tolcho'aatemman.<verse eid="HEB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Kunninna Mageni Abirhaamii'i, «Horte atixxi Yisaaqi darree'n ye'endaan» hiyye'eemmakemman. <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abirihaami Mageni reyeeka ke'issa dande'aaxxa hedeemman; Yisaaqiinna reyotenaa'n ke'eeke manjike fakkeenishsha haaroba alfe.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Yisaaqinna edi'a kaddaaxxa yaane hedeexxi Ya'iqoobinna Eesawuu'u amanat eebbise.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ya'iqoobi reyo'a shiqeexxa yanna mitte mittenda Yooseefixxa oose amanat eebbise; ifixxe siqqichchoxxe qacce hananna hirkateexxi magenooffate.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Yooseefi reya shiqeexxa yanna Isira'eelike ardixxa Gibtsee'n fula amanat haaso'e; ifixxe miqexxeenna ajaja uwwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Muuse ilemeechchi uduma isik hadi isi dancha anno kadeexxa uundeemmaxxee amanat sase agenjo isoo sho'ye; moyanjiinka ajajanna sodaanteba'a.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Muuse nophpheechchi uduma, «Feri'oonixxe beltoke belto» hiyyema amanat gibe. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Heenoxxe yanna'a cubboti afemaake gammadi mannii'n Mageniinke ardinni welti rakko adhdha fi'le. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Edi'a alfaaka hira uudeemmaxxee Gibtseexxe karra mannii'n Kiristoosixxee rakko adhdha hara caaldaaxxe karra kaddeexxa qalbeeffate.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Isi moyanjiinxa mufe sodaatebaang Gibtseeka boga waaleexxi amanat fule; ookkonee leella'nebaaka Mageno uude'eeshsha asseexxi ifike me'injo'n jabaate. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Angafa oose shiyammak iikki iimik erganji Isira'eelotixxa angafa oose shiyabaashsha Muuse sa'atike ayyaanixxe mundexxa fiffixxa asseek amanatiteemman.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ardi bago boga'n lekkati me'a'neeshsha diimoxxa abbaayya amanat foofe. Gibtsito kinni iitta assatee wo'laanda'n liqiinsende.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Isira'eelto Iyyarkoka dalla'a torbaane barra dooteechchi uduma iikki dalla'i ibeek amanatiten.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Iitti yabaabbulleti galda'eemmaxxi Re'aabi ookkonee dooyyammaka manna nage'ik adhdhitemmaxxee ookkonee ajajemebaake manninni welti shiyyendebaak gatteechchi amanatiten.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Yoona konnechchi caala maa hiyyanota? Gedewoonixxee, Baaraaqixxee, Somisoonixxee, Yofitaheexxee Daawwitixxee, Saamu'eelixxee, iittanni wabeekotixxee ha'no'n xingabe'noshsha yanna afebe'no? <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kunni manni amanat moottumuwwa injifante; qullummati galchine; ookkonee uwwemeeka addachchiisatika hiyyichchonna adhdhine; neequwwiinka afo'uwwanna cunfe. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Giiratixxa hunna xolsine; wolaantichchiinke qaranaa'ni gantee, ifi ifixxe ifi gophanaa'ni jabeenna alfine; bagedik worba manna kande; alagiinka loliinka mannanna shorrine. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Melaalle reyeemmaka ifi ifika ifiruwwa ke'e'naa adhdhite; weli kinni caaldaaxxa reyotenaa'n ke'a alfatee hiyyeexxi reyaate geesisaake gagr gargar hedheeke abari'a ifi uwwe; usurakenaa'ninna fulo'a hanseba'a. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Weli wel gacifachchotike kade, ganeme; wel kinni usuremeexxi useriinke mine'n huneme. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Kinoti cancaqqemme, magaazeti lameba darremme; wolaantichchik otemmeexxi renne; re'etikanna gedhebiinka goga oddo'wineexxi doonsakiyya hine; hiyyeeyyetenna rakkiyyete kandeexxi wixxixi hine. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Tinni butta insa'ne'a eloxxe kada gophemmaxxee qiilla gammoojje'ninna kooba kooba'n, wolo'o wolo'ninna bale bale'n jeekki hine.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Kunni manni duuchchi insa'nexxe amanaxxee dhugaa kulendee'naa'n insa'ne giddii'n ayyinna ookkonee addachchiisatika hiyyichcho adhdheek hedheba'a. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Mageni no'aa caaldaaxxa yaane qixxeesseemmaxxee insa'ne no'onni weltite malee qofit wo'make kada dandeenaba'a.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mageni Oose Ifixxa Mura Woxisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Yoona tenneera labbaaxxa heddo dhugaa kulaara duumanchiishsha qaraqara no'oke'n hexxeechchinni no'o'ni ba'ote kaddaaxxa yaane duuchcha, sholla qicinni takaaldeexxi no'oo abidaaxxa cubbo fuggussinennexxi no'o edo hedheeka gongichcho ossunteti gongino. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />No'oxxe amanaka ke'issallonna muuxallo kade'eek Yessuusi'n ille no'oxxa uggudhino; isi ifi edo heexxeexxe gammashshoxxee eettene fannisenshaka salphinne mayiinshanna laakko'ebaang fannotixxe rakko'ninna reyo'n ossati, Mageniinxe mootteke midda'n ofo'leen. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Yoona ifi gophineexxi godoba kultitinabaashsha cubbaalyetenaa'n iso'n gelteexxa tennee labbaaxxa xaa'na'ni osseeka isoo hedde.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Ha'noo cubboti welti wo'laancho abixxati munde ha'nooxxa dundinaa qico'n ta'anna gareertinbaan. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Mageni ha'noo isixxe oose kaddineemma qicinni ha'noo'ni haaso'eeka jajjabeessaka hiyyichcho deetine'een</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Anke belto Goottiinxa mura shollishshoxxee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">atee xixaa woddanna kodoba kultitoxxe.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Tinninna kaddaachchi Gootti eeyaake xixaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">belto ifikishsha uudaakanna mura woxisaan.»<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Magen ha'noo ifixxe ooseshsha uude'een isike xixichchika gorsa ossitine adhdhe. Isinni anni xixabaak belti ayyete? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Oosse kadeek duuchchi adhdhitaaka xixichcho ha'noo adhdha gophphinoole ha'noo baanake malee'e seeriixxe oosebaan. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Konne irra no'oo duuchchiing xixaaka maaliinka annuwwa anfeennan; insa'neenna ulfeessina'ennan. Eega hedhoti hedhaatee hafuuruwwiinke anna no'okee hittaa caala ajajemati gonphannota? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />No'ok annuwwi insa'ne'ni eloxxe fakkaatexxi leelitee qicinni heenoxxe yanna'aa no'oo xinxa'nemman; yaane kinni Mageni no'oo isixxa woyyumma qoodemmannoke kandannoshsha no'oxxe la'o'aa no'oo mura woxisaan. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mura woxa eettene yanna'ni yaadisaa malee'e gammachchiissaxxe fakkaatabaan; uduma kinni isoo barateeke manni'a nage'i wo'meexxa qullumatixxe gumma insa'ne'aa afissaani.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gorsakanna Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Tennexxee shaqqiteexxa ha'nooxxa anguwwanna gophpheeka ha'nooka gulubo jabeesse! <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Hokkoleek fayyaashate malee caala fitiriki hiyyabaashsha lekka ha'nooxxee eloka ora giise.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageno Ajajema gophatixxee Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Manji duuchchinni welti nage'iki hedhatee dandeetineexxa duuchcha aasse; woyyoletenna kadde; woyyummabelo ayyinna Gootta uuda dande'abaan. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Ha'noonaa'n ayyinna Mageniinke badhaadhi isonaa'n xe'yabaashsha xexxe'atte! Iittanni qararanji hiddi lateexxi ha'noo rakkisabaashsha, heddo manna battoossabaashsha xexxe'atte. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mitte yannaxxe it'aa hiyyeexxi angafumma ifixxa gurgudheemmake Eesawushsha ayyinna yabaabultike adabike manjo yookaani Mageno ulfeessabaake kade afemabashsha xexxe'atte! <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Udumii'n Eesa eettene eebba dhaalo'a haseexxa yanna hoyyemmeexxa egendine'een; isi eebbatanna indiddoti jaaba qico halsoolna midde langaxxa alfa dande'ebaan.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Ha'noo eettene angati abidema dande'amaxxe yookaan gubattaammaxxe Siinaxxa kooba geltinebaan; eettene hurrebaa'a, eettene dukkanabaa'a, eettene hobonbaltebaa'a, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />malagatiink hafuur yookaan haaso'ema'neek hiyyichchi laqenshabaa geltinebaan; konne hiyyichcho laqeek manninna, «Ta'inni udmi'a weli haaso'i lebemeexxi haaso'emoqqe» hineexxi kadhante. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Tinni kaddeechchi «Hore midde eettene kooba tuqeexxe kaddoole kinjik cancaqemeexxi shiyemowwaal» hiyyaake hiyyichchika ajaja ba'edha dandennebaan. <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ookko leellita'emmaxxi yaane lumoshsha sodachchiisaaxxe kaddeemmaxxee Muuse midde, «Sodaatte culphisennen» hiyye.<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ha'noo kinni Tsiiyoonnixxe koobabaa, iimixxe Iyyerusaalemibaa, ookkone hedhoke Mageniinke qachchibaa dagine'een; gammashshoti bukki hiteexxi laakkosi tennete hiyyendabaaxxe ergannabaa shiqqine'een. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Summi insa'nek iima borreessemeeke angafa oose kaddeexxe amaynetixxe bukkibaa, duuchchiinge'ni muraake kadeeke Magniba, wo'munte alfe'eke qullichcha hafuuruwwibaa shiqineen. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Haaroxxe kako'a oddichchake kadeeke Yessuusibaa iittanni Aabelixxe munde mannii'n woyya hiyyemaaka hiyyichcho haaso'ammake eettene fiffixendeexxe mundebaa shiqqine'een.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Isoo ookkone haaso'a'neeka gibinabaashsha xexxe'atte; iikki buttate'n hedheexxi insa'nee xexxe'achchiisammaka ginbee wodda gantebaachchinni no'oo iikki iimi'ni dageek no'oo xexxe'achchiisa'n isinaa'ni bayyantonnole hittata fulchedha dandeennannota? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Eettene yanna hafuuri isiki sheke sheke asseek buttatemman; «Ta'a kinni butta calla kaddebaang iimuwwatanna mitte yanna lebe sheke sheke assannon» hiyye addachchiise'een. <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Tinni «Mittele lebennexxi» hiyyemeeki hiyyichchi leellishaachi iikki lele'mabaakiir jabaate hedhaashsha sheke sheke hiyyaakiir kunniirinna dademeechchuwwi fugussemaakeraan.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Tennexxee hara lele'mitabaaxxa mootumma adhdhina'enexxee Mageno galatenfato; iittanni gammachchiisake orinninna soda'atinna ulfeesat isoo magenoonfanto. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Tinninna Mageni no'ok eettene balleessitammaxxe giirashsha kadeemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Muuxamiika Gorsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Weli'aani weli dayyuwwiinsha weli eeyye. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Keessumma adhdha deetinoqqee; mitti mitti tenne assaa wodda egennebaang erganna keesunse'een. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Usuremeeka manna insa'nenni welti usurendineeshsha hexxine insa'ne hedde; iittanni manjiinxe anga'n rakko adhdheekaara ha'no rakko ifi'a adhdhitina'neesha kaddine'e insa'nee hedde.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Aadha heerumi duuchchiniinge'n ulfatteeke kadowwaal; qii'misaakeenna yabaabulake manna'n Mageni muraammaxxee ma'natinna luqqittete kaddowwaal. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Umo ha'nooka maalaqiinxe e'yanaa'n ifi heqqedhe; affineengechchi ha'noo geyowwaal; Mageni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">«Haranga atee waalabo'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">atee hunabo'no» hiyye'een.<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Tennexxee wo'ma qalbenna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">«Mageni anke gargaarsanjonni sodaatabe'no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">ani'a manji maa asso'a dande'a?» hinanoon.<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mageniinka hiyyichcho ha'noo'ni kulemmaka ha'nooka akeekisanjuwwa qalliyye; galduma insa'neekixxa gummanna uudina'n amanatinna insa'eenni fakkaatte. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yessuusi Kiristoosi bereqe, telchonna duuchchi woddi'a isi isonden.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Gargar gargar hexxeexxe alaga barachchonni booji'endinoqqee; qalbe ha'nooxxi uduuda horataak itattinna ha'watite kaddebaak badhaadhik kaddoole eloxxen. Tenne ita ha'watixxa aada hordofeek manni mitte la'o alfe'nemabaan.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Ookkone dunkaani giddo ergatemaakiir ookko'n itattixxa eetti alfinebaaka tolchimalcho anfe'ennen. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Umi qeessichchi cubbo birratixxe kadaaxxa horiinxa munde abixxeexxi woyyo woyyiteba'a e'yaan; ookkone horiki maali kinni dalla'ii gadhi darre gubataan. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Iittanni Yessuusi munde ifixxinni arda woyyonsatee qachchinxe hula gadhi darre rakko adhdhe. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Tennexxee isi ba'edheeka salphina ba'enenexxi ola'inii gadhi darre fullo. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Tinni kaddachchinna no'o kaba hedhaaka qachcha anfebe'noni. Yaane kinni edi'a dagaake qachcha heqe'na'ennen. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Tennexxee duuchchinni wodda galatiinika tolcha kunninna summa isika saaddaaxxa afo'inxa gumma Yessuusi darre'n Magenokee shiqinsho. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Iittanni eloxxa yaane assatanna affineecho weli manninni qoodema deetinoqee; Mageni gammadaak iitta hedheeke tolcha'niten. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Hanoke akeekisanjuwwi'a ajajendine hireme; tinni kaddaachchinna insa'ne jaba qicinni laqemmaxxi yaane hexxemmaxxee ha'noxxe lubboxxe yaane'a hunja'neen; tennexxee huja'nexxa huje yaadotite kaddebaak gammashshoti hunjaashsha insa'ne'a ajajemme; tinni kada gophphoole ha'noo la'o afinebaan.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />No'o'aanna sooddattee! Duuchchiinge ora'n eloka galduma galati hasissa'neexxa luqite sammo anfeenexxa konkeennen. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Giddii'ninna ha'noba rakke dagonna'a ani'a kadhatino'a maganne hiyya'ennen.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Duuchchi woddixxe kakoxxe mundenni gedhebiinke lumoke allalissanjo kadeedheeka Gootta no'oka Yessuusi Kirstoosi reyotenaa'n ke'iseeke nage'inke Mageni <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />fedhi isixxa assitinaashsha eloxxe yaane duuchchinni ha'noo ka'lishowwaal; isoo gammachchiissaxxanna Yessuusi Kiristoosi darre'ni no'o'n huccowwaal; isi'a duuchchi woddi'a ulfinni kadowwaal. Ameen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Anke dayyuwwaa! Ha'no'a borreesseneexxi erga harumaaxxe kaddeemmashshanni anka gorsiinka hiyyichcho ossati adhdhitinaashsha ha'noo magane hiyya'ennen. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Dayyi no'oki Ximotoosi usurakenaa'ni tikemeexxa egendino'a eeyya'ennen; rakke dageexxe kaddoole ha'noo uudona'a isinni welti dagannon. <verse eid="HEB 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Ha'nooke akeekisanjuwwi duuchchi'aanna Woyyole duuchchi'a nage'a anka shiqishshe. Ixaaleyii'n daggeexxi kirisitoositonna na'ge'aa ha'no'aa shiqqissa'neen. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Badhaadhi duuchchingenninni welti hedhowwaal.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>